{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_393a89decc217335128a19a8061fcb03c78a04fcd9620f35e34b405bae33eaaa"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the codebase layout is main.go dispatching subcommands, internal/ui as a Bubble Tea program, internal/tmux for the dedicated socket, internal/store for SQLite state, and internal/status for classifying pane output."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4bb283606bcd897a87dc54c262f3e8ad737dbbb46739f2b0d5983c60f5b0a0e9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors should keep the product a thin wrapper around supported TUIs, avoiding hardcoded models and provider-specific features, and do feature work in an isolated git worktree."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9c5da556c2d145f176791006c1991c10606765cb95c5a2a80826063e8e001420"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: releases are cut locally with goreleaser from a clean worktree at the tag, with no release workflow in CI; AUR_KEY is required or the Arch package publish silently skips."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e825889515b7b4d46bbba3f986dfce0fd01d2296ad5d01838eba3c9e68362f59"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: tests must run as `env -u TMUX TMUX_TMPDIR=/tmp/amtest go test ./...` because the suite drives a real tmux server and a bare go test could hit the live socket; gofmt and go vet must be clean before finishing."}],"claim_ids":["clm_393a89decc217335128a19a8061fcb03c78a04fcd9620f35e34b405bae33eaaa","clm_4bb283606bcd897a87dc54c262f3e8ad737dbbb46739f2b0d5983c60f5b0a0e9","clm_9c5da556c2d145f176791006c1991c10606765cb95c5a2a80826063e8e001420","clm_e825889515b7b4d46bbba3f986dfce0fd01d2296ad5d01838eba3c9e68362f59"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_2c1dc487a15a4f02bca39204ffbae07e","id":"pg_da6681c024925dcc87f5c0b4d39c108d","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/yoanwai-agent-manager-agents-md-0f40e31fb1ca-c0b4d39c108d.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_00685acfe4df544897473a3f347220b6"],"title":"YoanWai/agent-manager/AGENTS.md @ 0f40e31fb1ca","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:26:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2c1dc487a15a4f02bca39204ffbae07e"}
